- Meta Model
    Worker (Agent)
        is bottleneck: yes
        is tangible: no
        useful life: infinite
        write off method: not applicable
        maximum worker pool: 1
        thread
            Concurrent (Single-Threading)
                - Synchronise
                - Re-entrant Lock
                - Event
                - Condition
                - Barrier
                fixes
                    - shared state
                        - delete (design away)
                        - clamp into single complex (no shared medium)
                        - coordinate once, offline, by convention
                        - pass messages and isolate (guard)
                            - separate service
                            - hide information
                        - reduce costs
                            - free riding
                            - unreliable channels sacrifice consistency or availability
                    - externalise
                        - pre-computed
                        - parallelised
                        - asynchronised
                        - defer
                    - add cheaper resources
                        - diversified copies
                            - multi-version concurrency
                            - readers never block writers
                            - (no lock at all)
                            - validate on commit only
                        - buffer ("Slack")
                            - me
                            - another party
                        - fastest gun redundancy
                            - fire at several replicas and take first answer
                            - multiple nodes with same data
                        - optimistic concurrency (speculate then reconcile on rare miss)

                    - de-correlate the need from the specific resource
                    - satisficing (good enough optimisation of requirements)
                        - net and clear
                        - collapse the obligation graph
                    - outsource dependency to whoever can handle it better
                    - substitute collateral
